3. 養聲

廣東話：我今日聲帶發炎，所以唔好意思同你傾偈，我而家正喺度養聲。
English: My vocal cords are inflamed today, so I'm sorry I can't talk to you; I'm resting my voice right now.

4. 票尾

廣東話：張飛落咗嚟之後，我發現票尾仲留喺度，就當係收據啦。
English: After the ticket stub came off, I found the stub still there, so I treated it as a receipt.

5. hacker

廣東話：間公司最近被一個 hacker 入侵咗，所有客戶資料都漏咗出去。
English: The company was recently hacked by a hacker, and all customer data was leaked.

6. 石斛蘭

廣東話：花園入面種咗幾盆石斛蘭，佢哋依附喺樹上面生長，好特別。
English: There are a few phalaenopsis orchids planted in the garden; they grow attached to trees, which is quite special.

7. 吊詭

廣東話：佢話自己唔想出名，但每日都喺社交媒體上晒自己嘅生活，真係好吊詭。
English: He says he doesn't want to become famous, yet he posts his life on social media every day — that's really ironic.

8. 吊詭

廣東話：呢個方案好吊詭，想減省人手，結果仲要請多兩個人。
English: This plan is absurd — to cut down on staff, they ended up hiring two more people.

9. 各為其主

廣東話：兩個部門各為其主，最後連同一個客戶都爭住唔放。
English: The two departments each pursued their own interests, and in the end they even fought over the same client.

10. 軨蓋

廣東話：嗰部古裝戲入面，主角每次出場都戴住軨蓋，好威風。
English: In that period drama, the protagonist always wore a 軨蓋 when he appeared, looking very majestic.

11. 打哥夫

廣東話：阿豪每星期日都去公園打哥夫，仲帶咗朋友一齊玩。
English: Every Sunday, Ah Ho goes to the park to play golf, and he even brings his friends along.

12. 免揀

廣東話：呢間餐廳嘅甜品係免揀嘅，落單嗰陣就話一聲就得。
English: The desserts at this restaurant are complimentary — just let them know when you order.

13. 擺闊佬

廣東話：佢成日喺人面前擺闊佬，其實手頭上根本冇幾多錢。
English: He always shows off in front of people, but he actually doesn't have much money.

14. 廣播劇

廣東話：我細個好鍾意聽廣播劇，特別係夜晚嗰種懸疑嘅。
English: When I was young, I loved listening to radio dramas, especially the suspenseful ones at night.

15. 錄影機

廣東話：間屋入面仲有部舊錄影機，我哋用嚟錄電視節目。
English: There's still an old video recorder in the house, which we use to record TV programmes.

16. 吟詩吟唔甩

廣東話：佢偷咗公司嘅文件，最後被捉到，真係吟詩吟唔甩。
English: He stole the company's documents, and when he was caught, there was no way to deny it.

17. 佈道大會

廣東話：呢個星期日有間教會喺體育館開佈道大會，好多人去聽。
English: This Sunday, a church held a 佈道大會 at the sports hall, and many people went to listen.

18. 寫手

廣東話：呢本書嘅作者其實係一個寫手，佢幫其他作家代筆。
English: The author of this book is actually a ghostwriter who writes for other authors.

19. 寫手

廣東話：間雜誌請咗一個寫手，專責寫科技新聞。
English: The magazine hired a writer who specializes in technology news.

20. 代打

廣東話：我朋友請咗一個代打幫佢打機，因為佢今日好忙。
English: My friend hired a 代打 to play games for him because he's busy today.

21. 茶碗

廣東話：嗰套茶具入面，個茶碗係用陶瓷燒製而成，好適合飲茶。
English: Among the tea set, the 茶碗 is made of ceramic, which suits 飲茶 perfectly.

22. 茶隔

廣東話：斟茶嗰陣，我哋會用茶隔將茶葉同茶湯分開，先倒落杯入面。
English: When pouring tea, we use a 茶隔 to separate the leaves from the liquor before pouring it into the cup.

23. 只許州官放火，不准百姓點燈

廣東話：佢自己成日遲到，仲要訓人唔准遲到，真係只許州官放火，不准百姓點燈。
English: He's always late himself, yet tells others not to be late — a textbook case of 只許州官放火，不准百姓點燈.

24. 獨唱

廣東話：今晚嘅演唱會，佢會唱一首獨唱，唔會同人一齊唱。
English: At tonight's concert, he'll perform a solo song rather than sing with others.

25. 快人快事

廣東話：佢係個快人快事，有咗機會就即刻把握，唔會拖泥帶水。
English: He's a 快人快事 — when an opportunity comes, he grabs it immediately without dragging his feet.

26. 四腳獸

廣東話：我哋喺廁所外面門縫望落去，見到一對四腳獸喺入面親熱。
English: Peeking through the gap in the toilet door, we saw a couple of 四腳獸 being intimate inside.

27. 無米粥

廣東話：呢個合作先係無米粥，好多重要條件仲未有著落，唔好期望過高。
English: This partnership is still just a 無米粥 — many key terms are unresolved, so don't get your hopes up too high.

28. 義會

廣東話：舊時低下階層會組成義會，大家定期集資，邊個急需用錢就標會拎錢。
English: In the past, lower-class people formed 義會, pooling money regularly so that anyone in need could borrow through a 標會.

29. 榜文

廣東話：嗰張榜文貼喺城門上面，寫住新嘅稅收規定。
English: The 榜文 was pasted on the city gate, announcing the new tax regulations.

30. MK名

廣東話：呢個網民成日用一個 MK名，配住一堆意味不明嘅特殊符號。
English: This netizen always uses an MK名, filled with meaningless special symbols. [end of text]


